<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 9 April <span class="n">8</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/zeno-emperor"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/zeno-emperor.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Zeno (emperor)</span><span class="tp">c. 425–491</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/henry-ii-the-pious"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/henry-ii-the-pious.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Henry II the Pious</span><span class="tp">c. 1196–1241</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/edward-iv-of-england"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/edward-iv-of-england.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Edward IV of England</span><span class="tp">1442–1483</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/alqas-mirza"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/alqas-mirza.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Alqas Mirza</span><span class="tp">1516–1550</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/william-v-prince-of-orange"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/william-v-prince-of-orange.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">William V, Prince of Orange</span><span class="tp">1748–1806</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/isabella-ii-of-spain"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/isabella-ii-of-spain.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Isabella II of Spain</span><span class="tp">1830–1904</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/jorge-eliecer-gaitan"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/jorge-eliecer-gaitan.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Jorge Eliécer Gaitán</span><span class="tp">1903–1948</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/zog-i"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/zog-i.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Zog I</span><span class="tp">1895–1961</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
